---
// About.astro - Minimalist Agency Statement conforming to DESIGN.md
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 bg-white dark:bg-[#0D0F14] text-[#171A20] dark:text-[#F4F4F4] scroll-mt-20 border-t border-[#EEEEEE] dark:border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-[1380px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Editorial Statement -->
      <div class="space-y-5 sm:space-y-6">
        <span class="text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-[#3E6AE1] uppercase block">
          Who We Are
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-[30px] sm:text-[38px] lg:text-[46px] font-medium leading-[1.18] text-[#171A20] dark:text-white text-balance">
          Social Media Management for Business
        </h2>

        <p class="text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-[#393C41] dark:text-[#C7CAD1] leading-[1.7] text-pretty">
          <strong>GrovexMedia</strong> is a digital growth studio. We help entrepreneurs, brands, and creators build a strong social media presence through celebrity giveaway campaigns and full channel management.
        </p>

        <p class="text-[15px] text-[#5C5E62] dark:text-[#A3A7B0] leading-[1.7] text-pretty">
          Social media changes quickly, and a simple posting schedule is not enough. We handle creator partnerships, video production, and translations that reach millions of viewers around the world.
        </p>

        <!-- Key Pillars Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-6 pt-6 border-t border-[#EEEEEE] dark:border-white/10">
          <div>
            <span class="text-[20px] font-medium text-[#171A20] dark:text-white block mb-1">Top 1%</span>
            <span class="text-[13px] text-[#5C5E62] dark:text-[#A3A7B0] leading-[1.5] block">Dedicated support for top entrepreneurs and creators.</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-[20px] font-medium text-[#171A20] dark:text-white block mb-1">Full Management</span>
            <span class="text-[13px] text-[#5C5E62] dark:text-[#A3A7B0] leading-[1.5] block">From ideas and scripts to editing, thumbnails, and daily uploads.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
            <span class="text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-medium text-[#171A20] dark:text-white block mb-1">Virality Boost Sales</span>
            <span class="text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] text-[#5C5E62] dark:text-[#A3A7B0] leading-[1.5] block">Turn views into revenue with shareable, high-reach content.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-open-audit
            class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto h-11 sm:h-10 px-6 text-[14px] font-medium cursor-pointer focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#3E6AE1] focus-visible:outline-none"
          >
            Start Your Growth Strategy
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Visual Frame & Trust Card -->
      <div>
        <div class="relative rounded-[12px] overflow-hidden bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-[#171A20] border border-[#EEEEEE] dark:border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8E8E8E] dark:text-[#8E939C] block mb-3">
              Growth Standard
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-[22px] font-medium text-[#171A20] dark:text-white mb-2">
              Your Media Team
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[14px] text-[#5C5E62] dark:text-[#A3A7B0] leading-[1.6]">
              We act as your media team, with vetted contracts and steady audience growth.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature Checklist -->
          <ul class="space-y-4 border-t border-[#EEEEEE] dark:border-white/10 pt-6 mb-8 text-[14px] text-[#393C41] dark:text-[#C7CAD1]">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#3E6AE1]/10 text-[#3E6AE1] flex items-center justify-center text-[12px] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">&check;</span>
              <span>Direct access to verified celebrity rosters &amp; official giveaways</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#3E6AE1]/10 text-[#3E6AE1] flex items-center justify-center text-[12px] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">&check;</span>
              <span>Direct communication with strategic growth leads</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#3E6AE1]/10 text-[#3E6AE1] flex items-center justify-center text-[12px] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">&check;</span>
              <span>Direct communication with strategic growth leads</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-[8px] bg-white dark:bg-[#1C1F26] border border-[#EEEEEE] dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col items-start gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="text-[13px] font-medium text-[#171A20] dark:text-white">Accepting Select Brands &amp; Creators</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[12px] text-[#8E8E8E] dark:text-[#8E939C] font-mono">Verified</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

